  "description": "Being popular is nothing new for Hyeok Ji-Seung. He’s always had admirers, and Tae Eon-Ho is just another one, aside from the whole being a guy thing. Ji-Seung found it Eon-Ho's terrible attempts at hiding his crush amusing…until Eon-Ho took things a step too far. Cute is one thing. Breaking into his room and hiding in his closet? That’s another story.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
